  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lifesaving humanitarian assistance to people affected by Flooding in the Bangsam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed response aims to address the unmet humanitarian needs, reduce suffering, and uphold the dignity of the most at -risk and underserved women, children, and men affected by massive flooding in Maguindanao Del Sur and the Special Geographic Areas (SGA) in Bangsamoro Autonomous Region in Muslim Mindanao (BARMM). An integrated assistance package consisting of cash and services to support access to food and basic and specific needs, Water Sanitation and Hygiene (WASH), and protection services will be delivered to 30,500 people using gender, conflict -sensitive, age, and disability -inclusive approaches.</narrative>
  </description>
